  UTC date of last NAC image:          2016 FEB 13 19:09:27.158               
  UTC date of first WAC image:         2014 AUG 05 00:20:43.281               
  UTC date of last WAC image:          2016 FEB 16 22:35:12.636               
  Number of NAC images:                16182                                  
  Number of WAC images:                5138                                   
  Minimum number of images per maplet: 7                                      
  Maximum number of images per maplet: 567                                    
  Average number of images per maplet: 161                                    
  Distance to surface:                 5.8-287 km(*)                          
  Lowest image resolution:             5.4 m/pixel(*)                         
  Highest image resolution:            0.11 m/pixel(*)                        
  Average image resolution:            1.6 m/pixel(*)                         
                                                                              
